WEBVTT

00:39:59.153 --> 00:40:01.800
EG: Well, first of all,
I want to say thank you to them,

00:40:01.824 --> 00:40:05.613
because when I made this announcement,
they responded with love and compassion.

00:40:05.637 --> 00:40:10.138
And I didn't get a single person say,
"You ruined my favorite book."

00:40:10.162 --> 00:40:13.611
People are human enough
and wise enough to know

00:40:13.635 --> 00:40:16.935
that my life didn't end
on the last page of that book,

00:40:16.959 --> 00:40:21.287
and in the same way that your life
didn't end last weekend.

00:40:21.311 --> 00:40:25.941
Our lives are this moving canvas
that's very chaotic,

00:40:25.965 --> 00:40:28.263
and stuff happens to people.

00:40:28.287 --> 00:40:30.293
Hearts change, you know?